# ============================================================
# Godot 4 — version-control ignore rules
# Project: 仙侠卡牌 / Xianxia Card Battler  (Godot 4.3 LTS, GDScript, 2D-first)
# Engine pin: see project.godot (config/features="4.3") and CLAUDE.md.
#
# Intent (S3-C3): ignore engine-generated / build artifacts only.
# DO NOT ignore source: scripts/ data/ tests/ art/ production/ design/ docs/
# are all tracked. Mono/C# rules are included for safety even though this
# project is GDScript-only.
# ============================================================

# --- Godot generated cache & temp ---
.godot/
.import
exported/
*.tmp

# --- Mono / C# build artifacts (unused here, kept per S3-C3 requirements) ---
.mono/
data_*/
mono_crash.*.json

# --- OS / editor junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# --- Local preview copies (duplicates of art/references/, for human viewing only) ---
# 见 art/preview-s3/：由脚本复制 25 张 S3 出图供肉眼验收，非源资产、不入库。
art/preview-s3/

# ============================================================
# NOTE: GUT (addons/gut) is intentionally NOT ignored.
# Per CLAUDE.md it is "由用户安装" (installed locally by the dev) and is
# fetched at CI runtime into addons/gut, so it is never committed from CI.
# If a developer chooses to VENDOR GUT into the repo, it will be tracked
# correctly because addons/ is not ignored above.
# ============================================================

# ============================================================
# Unity (团结引擎 1.9.3 / Unity 2022.3) — working project
# The Unity project under unity/ is a LOCAL WORKING COPY regenerated
# from source (src/core/Core → Assets/Scripts/Core, data/ copy, etc.).
# We version the SOURCE OF TRUTH in src/ and docs/, NOT the generated
# project. This keeps the repo lean and the GitHub push small.
# If you later want to version the Unity project, replace this single
# line with a full Unity .gitignore (Library/, Temp/, Obj/, Logs/,
# UserSettings/, Packages/packages-lock.json, etc.) and commit Assets/
# + ProjectSettings/ + Packages/.
# ============================================================
/unity/

# --- Generic Unity generated artifacts (safety net if path changes) ---
**/[Ll]ibrary/
**/[Tt]emp/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Ll]ogs/
**/UserSettings/
**/MemoryCaptures/

